{
  "//": [
    "©AngelaMos | 2026",
    "package.json.example",
    "",
    "Annotated package.json template for Cybersecurity-Projects frontends",
    "(Vite 8 + React 19 + TypeScript 7). Copy into frontend/, rename to",
    "package.json, replace every <PLACEHOLDER>.",
    "",
    "JSON has no comments. Top-level '//' keys are the npm/pnpm convention",
    "for documentation and are ignored by every package manager. They are",
    "ONLY safe at the top level here; never inside tsconfig compilerOptions.",
    "",
    "Docs: https://pnpm.io/package_json"
  ],

  "name": "<project-name>",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "<One-line description of the frontend>",
  "type": "module",

  "// packageManager": [
    "Exact pnpm pin, read by corepack, by pnpm itself, and by Dependabot when",
    "it regenerates pnpm-lock.yaml. Pinned to the repo-wide version so",
    "Dependabot never rewrites a lockfile with a different pnpm major. Bump it",
    "repo-wide, in one commit, together with the Dockerfiles that install",
    "pnpm.",
    "",
    "Dockerfiles: node:24 images ship corepack (`corepack enable && corepack",
    "prepare pnpm@<version> --activate`). node:25 and newer do NOT bundle",
    "corepack any more (node:26-alpine has no corepack binary), so on those",
    "images install pnpm directly at the pinned version."
  ],
  "packageManager": "pnpm@10.29.1",

  "// engines": "Floor set by the strictest dependency: react-router 8 requires Node >= 22.22. Current LTS is Node 26.",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.22.0"
  },

  "// scripts": [
    "Same names in every project, so anyone (and any CI job) can run",
    "`pnpm build`, `pnpm lint` or `pnpm typecheck` without reading the",
    "project first.",
    "",
    "build runs `tsc -b` FIRST: Vite (Oxc) strips types without checking",
    "them, so without it a type error ships to production."
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "vite",
    "build": "tsc -b && vite build",
    "preview": "vite preview",
    "typecheck": "tsc -b",
    "lint": "biome check .",
    "lint:fix": "biome check --write .",
    "format": "biome format --write .",
    "lint:scss": "stylelint '**/*.scss'",
    "lint:scss:fix": "stylelint '**/*.scss' --fix"
  },

  "// dependencies": [
    "Runtime code that ships in the bundle. Import only what you list;",
    "never rely on a transitive dependency being present.",
    "",
    "react-router (v8) replaces react-router-dom, which no longer exists.",
    "Import everything from 'react-router', and RouterProvider from",
    "'react-router/dom'."
  ],
  "dependencies": {
    "@tanstack/react-query": "^5.105.1",
    "axios": "^1.21.0",
    "react": "^19.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^19.3.1",
    "react-error-boundary": "^6.1.6",
    "react-icons": "^5.7.0",
    "react-router": "^8.5.1",
    "sonner": "^2.0.8",
    "zod": "^4.6.7",
    "zustand": "^5.0.16"
  },

  "// devDependencies": [
    "Build and quality tooling only; none of it reaches the browser.",
    "",
    "@biomejs/biome is pinned EXACTLY (no ^): a minor Biome release can",
    "change formatter output, and a floating range makes `biome check` pass",
    "on one machine and fail on another.",
    "",
    "typescript ~7.0: the native Go compiler. Tilde, because TypeScript does",
    "not follow semver and minor releases tighten checks.",
    "",
    "sass-embedded runs the Dart Sass compiler natively; Vite uses it",
    "automatically and it is several times faster than the pure-JS `sass`.",
    "",
    "Not needed any more: vite-tsconfig-paths (Vite 8 has",
    "resolve.tsconfigPaths), the npm:rolldown-vite alias (Vite 8 IS",
    "Rolldown), and stylelint-config-prettier-scss (nothing formats SCSS",
    "with Prettier; see stylelint.config.js.example)."
  ],
  "devDependencies": {
    "@biomejs/biome": "2.6.4",
    "@tanstack/react-query-devtools": "^5.105.1",
    "@types/node": "^26.6.6",
    "@types/react": "^19.3.0",
    "@types/react-dom": "^19.3.0",
    "@vitejs/plugin-react": "^6.2.1",
    "sass-embedded": "^1.107.1",
    "stylelint": "^17.16.0",
    "stylelint-config-standard-scss": "^17.0.0",
    "typescript": "~7.0.2",
    "vite": "^8.3.5"
  },

  "// pnpm settings": [
    "There is deliberately NO `pnpm` field here. pnpm 11+ ignores it",
    "completely, so overrides placed there silently stop applying the day",
    "the project moves past pnpm 10. Overrides, allowed build scripts and",
    "minimumReleaseAge belong in pnpm-workspace.yaml next to this file."
  ]
}
